{
  "name": "IC notes (leadership only)",
  "description": "Investment-committee conclusions and partners' views. Restrict this table to leadership after install; nothing here is mirrored into the shared tables.",
  "position": 4,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "record-ic",
      "label": {
        "en": "Record an IC decision",
        "zh-CN": "记录一次投决会结论"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder and follow it. Record the IC decision I describe for its project: the conclusion, the partners' view, and the conditions in words. Keep figures and fund economics out of it, and do not copy any of it into the shared tables.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，按它的规则做。为对应项目记录我描述的投决会结论：结论、合伙人意见、条件要点用文字写。不要写金额和基金收益，也不要把内容复制到共享表。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "ic-history",
      "label": {
        "en": "Show the IC history of one project",
        "zh-CN": "看一个项目的投决历史"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder and follow it. List every IC decision for the project I name, oldest first, with the conditions and whether the follow-ups that came out of them are done. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，按它的规则做。按时间顺序列出我说的项目的每次投决结论和条件，并核对由此产生的待跟进是否完成。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
